From 555ad6e962277b25b55a3ed54917556da7b56509 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ahmed asif rashid <asif.rashid@carrybee.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 07:08:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Next 14.2.35 to 16.4.6 and React 18 to 19.3.1

- Dynamic API routes under escalations/[id] await params (Next 15+ async params).
  Handler logic unchanged.
- Verified: npm test 108/108; next build --webpack exit 0; production server smoke:
  /login 200, protected APIs 401, /dashboard redirects to /login, [id] routes do not crash.
- Turbopack build was OOM-killed in the 2 GB sandbox; Vercel builds with Turbopack by default.
- middleware.js is deprecated in Next 16 (renamed to proxy). Still works; rename left as a follow-up.
- npm audit --omit=dev: 0 vulnerabilities.
---
